s-author\">Epictetus</span><span id=\"ws-article-id\">4535578</span><span id=\"ws-title\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Discourses_of_Epictetus;_with_the_Encheiridion_and_Fragments\" title=\"The Discourses of Epictetus; with the Encheiridion and Fragments\">The Discourses of Epictetus; with the Encheiridion and Fragments</a> \u2014 Book 2, Chapter 25</span><span id=\"ws-year\">1877</span><span id=\"ws-translator\">George Long</span></div></div>\n<p><span style=\"display:none\" id=\"dynamic&#95;layout&#95;overrider\">Layout 1</span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"prp-pages-output\" lang=\"en\">\n<p><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r13049624/mw-parser-output/.prp-pages-output\">.mw-parser-output .prp-pages-output .wst-heading{font-size:120%;text-align:center;margin-top:2em}</style><span><span class=\"pagenum ws-pagenum\" id=\"192\" data-page-number=\"192\" data-page-name=\"Page:Discourses of Epictetus.djvu/246\" data-page-index=\"246\" data-page-quality=\"3\" title=\"Page:Discourses&#95;of&#95;Epictetus.djvu/246\"><span id=\"pageindex&#95;246\" class=\"pagenum-inner ws-noexport\">&#8203;</span></span></span>\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r15620827\">.mw-parser-output .wst-center{text-align:center;margin:0 auto}.mw-parser-output .wst-center.wst-center-nomargin>p{margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0}</style><div class=\"wst-center tiInherit\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:120%;\">CHAPTER XXV.</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r15620827\" /><div class=\"wst-center tiInherit\">\n<p><span class=\"smallcaps\" style=\"font-variant:small-caps;\">that logic is necessary.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><span class=\"smallcaps\" style=\"font-variant:small-caps;\">When</span> one of those who were present said, Persuade me that logic is necessary, he replied, Do you wish me to prove this to you? The answer was\u2014Yes.\u2014Then I must use a demonstrative form of speech.\u2014This was granted.\u2014How then will you know if I am cheating you by my argument? The man was silent. Do you see, said Epictetus, that you yourself are admitting that logic is necessary, if without it you cannot know so much as this, whether logic is necessary or not necessary?\n&#32;\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Footnotes\">Footnotes</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=The_Discourses_of_Epictetus;_with_the_Encheiridion_and_Fragments/Book_2/Chapter_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Footnotes\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r14922110\">.mw-parser-output .wst-smallrefs{font-size:83%;clear:both;line-height:1.25;margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .wst-smallrefs ol.references{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .wst-smallrefs-ruled{border-top:1px solid;padding-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .wst-smallrefs ol.references.uksi{margin-top:0;list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .wst-smallrefs ol.references.uksi li::marker{font-weight:bold}</style>\n<div class=\"prp-pages-output\"><div class=\"reflist wst-smallrefs\" style=\"\">\n<ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">\u2191</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">See i. 17.</span>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw\u2010web.eqiad.main\u201077d845f446\u2010g7gcj\nCached time: 20260701201810\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: Module:Header (os.date(%Y))\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary\u2010page\u2010id, vary\u2010revision\u2010sha1]\nCPU time usage: 0.097 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.153 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 270/1000000\nRevision size: 